# Files a fresh worktree needs but git does not carry, because they are
# ignored. Without this, a worktree silently has no Alpaca MCP server, which
# D-010 recorded as a known gap.
#
# The pattern form matters: .claude/settings.local.json is ignored by a
# **/.claude/settings.local.json rule, so a bare path does not match it.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
